-- title:
--   Original BV source signed Fatou certificate from genuine finite stopped payoff grids
-- statement:
--   An honest source-exact reduction of the original bounded-variation signed Fatou certificate that accommodates nonnegative finite-grid payoffs F_n instead of assuming the global strict horizon reward is dominated at every stopped grid. Exact predictable compensated Lévy jump and negative HJB drift source equalities discharge every signed expectation budget through the proved original source theorem. The remaining genuine finite-grid C1/Stieltjes pathwise inequalities and a.e. liminf control are stated explicitly, with time-horizon identity to rule out a different source clock.
-- source:
--   E2 finite-grid variant of the canonical c1e2 signed Fatou obligation, importing public Proved f190214f for actual source expectations. No mean-zero or signed expectation premise and no circular canonical imports.

